rust/target-crate
rust/target/
results/*/
vendor/

# The repo-root .gitignore has a blanket `_*.py`, which silently swallowed
# _bench.py -- a REQUIRED module of the pymocks package (every other module
# imports it). A fresh clone therefore got a package that could not import, while
# azure kept working because the file existed there untracked. Re-include it here.
!pymocks/sonic_platform/_bench.py
